WEBVTT

00:00:00.052 --> 00:00:03.959
Read the diary without hiding the conflict Read the

00:00:04.025 --> 00:00:10.250
diary precisely Preparation is 09:30 to 10:00 the decision meeting is

00:00:10.303 --> 00:00:18.684
10:00 to 10:45 The supplier requests 09:45 to 10:15 This overlaps fifteen minutes

00:00:18.737 --> 00:00:23.105
of each existing commitment Do not hide either conflict

00:00:23.474 --> 00:00:27.447
shorten preparation silently or present the unverified request as

00:00:27.447 --> 00:00:31.553
an accepted booking Inspect each overlap and say which

00:00:31.592 --> 00:00:35.947
work would be displaced Distinguish an appointment request from

00:00:35.947 --> 00:00:37.184
an accepted booking
